{name:'S11 · Pandas DataFrame', code:
`import pandas as pd

df = pd.DataFrame({
    "Nombre": ["Ana", "Luis", "Maria", "Carlos"],
    "Edad": [30, 25, 35, 28],
    "Ciudad": ["Madrid", "Barcelona", "Sevilla", "Valencia"]
})

